  ## Gathering scalars

  In the simplest case the vectors in `indices` index the full rank of `params`:

  >>> tf.gather_nd(
  ...     indices=[[0, 0],
  ...              [1, 1]],
  ...     params = [['a', 'b'],
  ...               ['c', 'd']]).numpy()
