  row has a shape of `[3]` so the output shape is `[2, 3]`.

  In this case, the relationship between the shapes is:

  ```
  index_depth = indices.shape[-1]
  outer_shape = indices.shape[:-1]
  assert index_depth <= params.shape.rank
